      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Logically said, seat should detect FBT and correct it.\n\nBut FBT let allow move legs too and that is problem on seats. Seats have animation lock on leg and body btw.\n\nTo make sure you can sit normal, disable FBT (tracking) in your menu. Your avatar will then act like without leg tracking. Then you can do different seat positions without problem.\n\nMaybe in future seats will have option to disable FBT tracking, so world builders can decide to enable it or not. But overall, it should able to disable FBT tracking to ensure seating is working.",
